### Login OK (200)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

### Login datos invalidos (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "", "password": "" }

### Login credenciales incorrectas (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "otra" }

### Listar productos (200) - requiere Basic Auth
GET http://localhost:8080/api/productos
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### Buscar por id (200 / 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/productos/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin123

### Crear (201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/productos
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "codigo": "ABR-016", "nombre": "Quinua 500 g", "descripcion": "Bolsa de quinua", "categoria": "Abarrotes", "precio": 3.80, "stock": 20 }

### Actualizar (200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/productos/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
Content-Type: application/json

{ "codigo": "ABR-001", "nombre": "Arroz extra 5 kg", "descripcion": "Bolsa", "categoria": "Abarrotes", "precio": 25.50, "stock": 28 }

### Eliminar (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/productos/1
Authorization: Basic admin admin123
